"<p>We welcome contributions from developers worldwide!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>GitHub Issues:</strong> Report bugs and submit feature requests on <a href=\"https://github.com/nitrobase/nitrobase/issues\">GitHub</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Discord Community:</strong> Join our community to ask questions and share your deployments.</li>\n<li><strong>Contributing Templates:</strong> Submit pull requests to add new templates to the <code>templates/</code> directory!</li>\n</ul>"